/*
  Silverwing theme - the FlapX bird flying past a silver moon over a city in
  the clouds, all in brushed silver and pewter on midnight navy
  (res/images/silverwing.jpg). Monochrome: thin silver frames, polished metal
  title tabs and buttons with dark text, and pale moonlight blue for money
  coming in.

  The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables; the base colours come
  from the theme table in guiutil.cpp.
*/

